# The web app talks to its own origin. No configuration needed in prod —
# Caddy routes /orders, /menu, /staff, /devices, /payments, /health to the API,
# and everything else (including /admin and /kitchen) to this container.
#
# In dev, the Vite proxy in vite.config.ts forwards those same paths to
# http://localhost:8000, so you don't need an API URL here either.
